    "introduction": "Admiral Group provides insurance and personal-lending products, with UK motor insurance forming a central part of its business. It also offers products such as home, travel and pet insurance and operates insurance businesses in several European markets. Customers buy cover through its brands and distribution channels, while the group uses underwriting, pricing and claims management to assess and handle risk. Revenue includes insurance-related income and lending returns. Its model incorporates arrangements that share some insurance risk with partners. Performance depends on pricing policies appropriately, controlling claims costs and retaining customers, with repair inflation, weather events and changes in driving patterns affecting results.",
